And so, I kept my vibrato,
and that's kind of my signature.

00:09:50.589 --> 00:09:51.757
-Wow.
-Yeah.

00:09:51.757 --> 00:09:53.225
-Thanks mom and dad.
-My goat signature.

00:09:53.225 --> 00:09:55.227
-Your goat signature, yeah.

00:09:55.227 --> 00:09:59.130
I know in New York, you were
recently at a Mets game

00:09:59.130 --> 00:10:00.432
and cheering on the Mets.

00:10:00.432 --> 00:10:02.902
And I was like, "Oh, yeah,
I wonder how you do cheer

00:10:02.902 --> 00:10:04.637
at a game," because you get very
excited

00:10:04.637 --> 00:10:07.105
when you're cheering for
your sons, for your boys.

00:10:07.105 --> 00:10:08.274
I've seen --
-I do.

00:10:08.274 --> 00:10:09.775
-I mean, I've seen video.
-I get carried away.

00:10:09.775 --> 00:10:11.277
-You are one of those people.

00:10:11.277 --> 00:10:12.277
[ Laughter ]

00:10:12.277 --> 00:10:13.379
-One of those moms.

00:10:13.379 --> 00:10:14.613
-Yeah, you're one --
-Annoying moms.

00:10:14.613 --> 00:10:16.782
-Yeah, you just like --
[screams] and you scream.

00:10:16.782 --> 00:10:18.884
-Yeah. Yeah.
-Can you -- I mean,

00:10:18.884 --> 00:10:20.518
do people tell you to, like,
chill out?

00:10:20.518 --> 00:10:22.054
-I embarrass my kids.

00:10:22.054 --> 00:10:26.325
Actually, yeah, during -- my
little one -- the both of them,

00:10:26.325 --> 00:10:29.428
actually, practice taekwondo.

00:10:29.428 --> 00:10:33.532
And whenever they participate in
a tournament, taekwondo, they --

00:10:33.532 --> 00:10:35.500
I scream like a crazy woman.

00:10:35.500 --> 00:10:39.972
And the dojo master, last time,
he gave me two warnings.

00:10:39.972 --> 00:10:42.974
The second -- and he said --
-You can't warn Shakira.

00:10:42.974 --> 00:10:45.143
No, no, no, no, no.
-Yeah, he almost kicked me out.

00:10:45.143 --> 00:10:46.378
-Oh, my gosh.
-Because I was like,

00:10:46.378 --> 00:10:48.213
"Kick him in the head!
Kick him in the head!"

00:10:48.213 --> 00:10:49.415
You know, I --

00:10:49.415 --> 00:10:50.716
[ Laughter ]

00:10:50.716 --> 00:10:52.017
-No, she's not kidding.

00:10:52.017 --> 00:10:54.353
In fact, we asked you if you
have any video of you.

00:10:54.353 --> 00:10:57.089
We have video of you cheering
your son on when Sasha won

00:10:57.089 --> 00:10:58.857
first place in karate --
in taekwondo.

00:10:58.857 --> 00:10:59.891
Look at this.

00:10:59.891 --> 00:11:01.760
-[ Speaking in Spanish ]

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:05.097
[ Shakira screaming
and cheering ]

00:11:05.097 --> 00:11:09.501
-Oh, my God, Sasha!
Oh, my God, Sasha!

00:11:09.501 --> 00:11:11.504
[ Screaming ]

00:11:11.504 --> 00:11:12.605
[ Laughter ]

00:11:12.605 --> 00:11:13.605
[ Cheering ]

00:11:13.605 --> 00:11:14.907
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:11:14.907 --> 00:11:17.476
-That's a loving mom
right there.

00:11:17.476 --> 00:11:21.013
That is a good mom.
That is -- that's so funny.

00:11:21.013 --> 00:11:22.815
Oh, my gosh. You would have
thought that you won.

00:11:22.815 --> 00:11:24.683
Oh, my goodness.
That's great.

00:11:24.683 --> 00:11:28.086
Let's talk about your new NBC
series, "Dancing With Myself."

00:11:28.086 --> 00:11:30.355
-Yes.
-What is the idea behind this --

00:11:30.355 --> 00:11:32.758
this show?

00:11:32.758 --> 00:11:36.761
-To offer people from all walks
of life and all ages --

00:11:36.761 --> 00:11:39.832
A platform where they can
showcase their talents,

00:11:39.832 --> 00:11:42.101
but also their passion
for dance.

00:11:42.101 --> 00:11:43.602
You know, they don't have to be
virtuosos,

00:11:43.602 --> 00:11:46.472
they don't have to be
professionals.

00:11:46.472 --> 00:11:49.441
Most of them aren't.
But --

00:11:49.441 --> 00:11:51.844
-I like that you're not looking
at me, by the way.

00:11:51.844 --> 00:11:53.846
-Exactly. They just have to
dance like you.

00:11:53.846 --> 00:11:57.216
-Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
-No, They're --

00:11:57.216 --> 00:12:00.185
-Yeah.
-The idea with the show is --

00:12:00.185 --> 00:12:05.957
is just to offer an opportunity
and access to people from --

00:12:05.957 --> 00:12:08.493
yeah, from everywhere, and --
-To dance.

00:12:08.493 --> 00:12:12.230
-To dance and to show their
true passion for dance.

00:12:12.230 --> 00:12:15.734
You know, like, we had --
for example, we had doctors

00:12:15.734 --> 00:12:18.504
on the show, we had
construction workers,

00:12:18.504 --> 00:12:19.939
we had people in the military.

00:12:19.939 --> 00:12:22.007
We had dentists -- a lot of
dentists, actually.

00:12:22.007 --> 00:12:23.575
-Wow.
-For some strange reason.

00:12:23.575 --> 00:12:26.011
-It was almost called
"Dancing Dentists" at first.

00:12:26.011 --> 00:12:28.480
They changed the title to
"Dancing With Myself."

00:12:28.480 --> 00:12:31.917
I know our buddy, Nick Jonas,
is on with you, too.

00:12:31.917 --> 00:12:33.719
-Yeah.
-And -- yeah, he's a good --

00:12:33.719 --> 00:12:35.054
-He's awesome.
-Yeah, he's the best.

00:12:35.054 --> 00:12:37.122
And between the two of you,
I would never want to be

00:12:37.122 --> 00:12:38.824
in a dance contest.

00:12:38.824 --> 00:12:40.358
I want to --
I want to show a clip.

00:12:40.358 --> 00:12:41.826
Here's a look at
"Dancing With Myself."

00:12:41.826 --> 00:12:43.061
Check this out.

00:12:43.061 --> 00:12:46.832
-Jeremy, can I ask you
what you do for a living?

00:12:46.832 --> 00:12:50.168
-Absolutely. So, I am
a plus size model in a --

00:12:50.168 --> 00:12:52.470
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Hey!

00:12:52.470 --> 00:12:55.407
-You might not be the most
technical dancer,

00:12:55.407 --> 00:12:56.842
but I don't care.

00:12:56.842 --> 00:12:59.411
Every time I see you dance --
I don't know, it's something

00:12:59.411 --> 00:13:02.147
contagious, something infectious
about what you're doing.

00:13:02.147 --> 00:13:04.049
[ Laughter ]

00:13:04.049 --> 00:13:05.951
And I just want to see more
of you.

00:13:05.951 --> 00:13:07.286
Can you show me a model face?

00:13:07.286 --> 00:13:08.487
[ Audience oohs ]

00:13:08.487 --> 00:13:09.888
-Work. Pose.

00:13:09.888 --> 00:13:13.225
Pose, pose.
-No, I smile. [ Laughs ]

00:13:13.225 --> 00:13:14.860
-You know, I don't have
a model face,

00:13:14.860 --> 00:13:15.961
so I have a mirror face.

00:13:15.961 --> 00:13:17.496
I go --
-I've never noticed it.

00:13:17.496 --> 00:13:18.563
Not once.

00:13:18.563 --> 00:13:20.633
-Work, Queen. Work.

00:13:20.633 --> 00:13:22.468
[ Laughter ]

00:13:22.468 --> 00:13:24.569
-Do you have a mirror face?
-No.

00:13:24.569 --> 00:13:25.703
-Come on, Nick.

00:13:25.703 --> 00:13:28.707
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:13:28.707 --> 00:13:30.475
-Hey, not the lip bite.

00:13:30.475 --> 00:13:32.544
-Yeah, that's how you do it,
right there.

00:13:32.544 --> 00:13:34.413
Shakira, everybody!

